. (1992). Consent forms: How to determine and improve their readability. Oncology Nursing Forum,19(10), 1523&#x02013;1528. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1461766</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR10"><label>10.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ott</surname><given-names>BB</given-names></name><name><surname>Hardie</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Readability of written materials: Implications for critical care nurses</article-title><source>Dimensions of Critical Care Nursing</source><year>1995</year><volume>14</volume><issue>6</issue><fpage>328</fpage><lpage>334</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00003465-199511000-00011</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Ott, B. B., &#x00026; Hardie, T. L. (1995). Readability of written materials: Implications for critical care nurses. Dimensions of Critical Care Nursing,14(6), 328&#x02013;334. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8631215</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ott</surname><given-names>BB</given-names></name><name><surname>Hardie</surname><given-names>TL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Readability of advance directive documents</article-title><source>Image&#x02014;The Journal of Nursing Scholarship</source><year>1997</year><volume>29</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>53</fpage><lpage>57</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1547-5069.1997.tb01140.x</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Ott, B. B., &#x00026; Hardie, T. L. (1997). Readability of advance directive documents. Image&#x02014;The Journal of Nursing Scholarship,29(1), 53&#x02013;57. <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9127541</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Calderon</su